{"page":126,"width":2000,"height":2831,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"118","words":[{"text":"118","x":194,"y":151,"width":73,"height":34}]},{"text":"CHAPTER02 • 애플리케이션 계층","words":[{"text":"CHAPTER02","x":584,"y":150,"width":172,"height":25},{"text":"•","x":790,"y":156,"width":12,"height":12},{"text":"애플리케이션","x":836,"y":149,"width":161,"height":30},{"text":"계층","x":1010,"y":149,"width":53,"height":30}]},{"text":"실전원리","words":[{"text":"실전원리","x":1484,"y":291,"width":173,"height":49}]},{"text":"DNS: 클라이언트-서버 패러다임을 통한 주요 네트워크 기능","words":[{"text":"DNS:","x":597,"y":405,"width":86,"height":30},{"text":"클라이언트-서버","x":697,"y":401,"width":237,"height":35},{"text":"패러다임을","x":947,"y":401,"width":151,"height":34},{"text":"통한","x":1109,"y":400,"width":61,"height":34},{"text":"주요","x":1180,"y":401,"width":62,"height":33},{"text":"네트워크","x":1253,"y":400,"width":122,"height":34},{"text":"기능","x":1386,"y":400,"width":60,"height":34}]},{"text":"HTTP, FTP, SMTP처럼 DNS 프로토콜은 (1) 클라이언트-서버 구本e 통신하는 종단 사이에","words":[{"text":"HTTP,","x":596,"y":466,"width":98,"height":34},{"text":"FTP,","x":711,"y":466,"width":73,"height":34},{"text":"SMTP처럼","x":800,"y":464,"width":148,"height":32},{"text":"DNS","x":962,"y":464,"width":69,"height":30},{"text":"프로토콜은","x":1042,"y":463,"width":144,"height":32},{"text":"(1)","x":1197,"y":463,"width":39,"height":33},{"text":"클라이언트-서버","x":1248,"y":463,"width":223,"height":33},{"text":"구本e","x":1483,"y":465,"width":84,"height":31},{"text":"통신하는","x":1580,"y":462,"width":114,"height":34},{"text":"종단","x":1704,"y":462,"width":59,"height":33},{"text":"사이에","x":1772,"y":462,"width":82,"height":34}]},{"text":"서 수행되며, (기 통신하는 종단 시스템 A삐에서 DNS 메시지를 전달하기 위해 하위 종단 트랜스","words":[{"text":"서","x":595,"y":515,"width":28,"height":32},{"text":"수행되며,","x":633,"y":516,"width":128,"height":35},{"text":"(기","x":776,"y":515,"width":39,"height":33},{"text":"통신하는","x":826,"y":516,"width":115,"height":32},{"text":"종단","x":950,"y":515,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"시스템","x":1019,"y":515,"width":84,"height":33},{"text":"A삐에서","x":1115,"y":515,"width":114,"height":33},{"text":"DNS","x":1242,"y":516,"width":69,"height":30},{"text":"메시지를","x":1323,"y":515,"width":114,"height":33},{"text":"전달하기","x":1447,"y":515,"width":113,"height":33},{"text":"위해","x":1572,"y":515,"width":55,"height":32},{"text":"하위","x":1639,"y":514,"width":54,"height":33},{"text":"종단","x":1705,"y":513,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"트랜스","x":1772,"y":514,"width":84,"height":31}]},{"text":"프로토콜에 의존하드로 애플리케이션 계층 프로토콜이다. 그러나 다른 의미에서, DNS의 역","words":[{"text":"프로토콜에","x":662,"y":567,"width":144,"height":32},{"text":"의존하드로","x":818,"y":567,"width":144,"height":32},{"text":"애플리케이션","x":971,"y":567,"width":172,"height":32},{"text":"계층","x":1155,"y":567,"width":56,"height":33},{"text":"프로토콜이다.","x":1221,"y":567,"width":183,"height":32},{"text":"그러나","x":1418,"y":567,"width":88,"height":32},{"text":"다른","x":1516,"y":567,"width":57,"height":32},{"text":"의미에서,","x":1583,"y":566,"width":123,"height":37},{"text":"DNS의","x":1723,"y":566,"width":94,"height":31},{"text":"역","x":1829,"y":568,"width":25,"height":32}]},{"text":"할은 웹, 파일 전송, 그리고 전자에일 애플리케이션고는 매우 다르다. 이들 애플리케이션과는 다","words":[{"text":"할은","x":596,"y":618,"width":57,"height":32},{"text":"웹,","x":665,"y":619,"width":40,"height":35},{"text":"파일","x":721,"y":618,"width":57,"height":32},{"text":"전송,","x":791,"y":619,"width":68,"height":35},{"text":"그리고","x":874,"y":619,"width":88,"height":32},{"text":"전자에일","x":974,"y":618,"width":112,"height":33},{"text":"애플리케이션고는","x":1099,"y":619,"width":230,"height":33},{"text":"매우","x":1342,"y":619,"width":57,"height":33},{"text":"다르다.","x":1411,"y":619,"width":95,"height":32},{"text":"이들","x":1523,"y":620,"width":57,"height":32},{"text":"애플리케이션과는","x":1591,"y":618,"width":226,"height":33},{"text":"다","x":1829,"y":620,"width":27,"height":32}]},{"text":"르게, DNS는 사용자가 직접 상호작용하는 애플리케이션이 아니다. 대신에 DNS는 핵심적인 인","words":[{"text":"르게,","x":594,"y":670,"width":70,"height":36},{"text":"DNS는","x":682,"y":670,"width":99,"height":32},{"text":"사용자가","x":791,"y":670,"width":117,"height":33},{"text":"직접","x":920,"y":670,"width":55,"height":33},{"text":"상호작용하는","x":988,"y":671,"width":172,"height":33},{"text":"애플리케이션이","x":1172,"y":671,"width":199,"height":33},{"text":"아니다.","x":1386,"y":671,"width":95,"height":33},{"text":"대신에","x":1499,"y":672,"width":83,"height":32},{"text":"DNS는","x":1597,"y":673,"width":96,"height":31},{"text":"핵심적인","x":1705,"y":671,"width":112,"height":32},{"text":"인","x":1829,"y":673,"width":26,"height":32}]},{"text":"터넷 기능을 제공한다. 즉, 인터넷에서 사용자 애플리케이션과 다른 소프트웨어를 위해 호스트 네","words":[{"text":"터넷","x":597,"y":721,"width":54,"height":32},{"text":"기능을","x":665,"y":721,"width":86,"height":33},{"text":"제공한다.","x":761,"y":721,"width":126,"height":33},{"text":"즉,","x":901,"y":722,"width":40,"height":37},{"text":"인터넷에서","x":957,"y":722,"width":141,"height":33},{"text":"사용자","x":1109,"y":722,"width":89,"height":34},{"text":"애플리케이션과","x":1208,"y":723,"width":201,"height":33},{"text":"다른","x":1420,"y":724,"width":57,"height":32},{"text":"소프트웨어를","x":1486,"y":725,"width":171,"height":32},{"text":"위해","x":1669,"y":725,"width":54,"height":31},{"text":"호스트","x":1734,"y":725,"width":85,"height":28},{"text":"네","x":1830,"y":726,"width":25,"height":31}]},{"text":"임을 하위 IP 주소로 변환하는 기능을 제공한다. 앞 1.2절에서 인터넷 구조의 많은 복잡성이 네트","words":[{"text":"임을","x":596,"y":772,"width":58,"height":33},{"text":"하위","x":664,"y":774,"width":56,"height":32},{"text":"IP","x":733,"y":775,"width":30,"height":28},{"text":"주소로","x":773,"y":774,"width":87,"height":31},{"text":"변환하는","x":870,"y":774,"width":115,"height":32},{"text":"기능을","x":995,"y":774,"width":86,"height":33},{"text":"제공한다.","x":1091,"y":775,"width":125,"height":33},{"text":"앞","x":1231,"y":775,"width":30,"height":32},{"text":"1.2절에서","x":1273,"y":776,"width":136,"height":32},{"text":"인터넷","x":1422,"y":776,"width":83,"height":32},{"text":"구조의","x":1516,"y":777,"width":85,"height":32},{"text":"많은","x":1613,"y":777,"width":56,"height":32},{"text":"복잡성이","x":1678,"y":775,"width":112,"height":33},{"text":"네트","x":1802,"y":776,"width":54,"height":31}]},{"text":"워크의 “가장자리가 있다고 했다. 네트워크의 가장자리에 위치하여 클라이언트와 서버를 이용하","words":[{"text":"워크의","x":596,"y":824,"width":85,"height":33},{"text":"“가장자리가","x":695,"y":825,"width":166,"height":33},{"text":"있다고","x":875,"y":826,"width":87,"height":32},{"text":"했다.","x":973,"y":826,"width":67,"height":33},{"text":"네트워크의","x":1059,"y":827,"width":141,"height":32},{"text":"가장자리에","x":1213,"y":827,"width":143,"height":33},{"text":"위치하여","x":1369,"y":828,"width":113,"height":33},{"text":"클라이언트와","x":1495,"y":829,"width":172,"height":32},{"text":"서버를","x":1678,"y":829,"width":84,"height":31},{"text":"이용하","x":1775,"y":827,"width":83,"height":33}]},{"text":"여 이름-주소 사이의 변환 프로세스를 구현하는 DNS는 그러한 설계 철학의 또 다른 예다.","words":[{"text":"여","x":596,"y":876,"width":27,"height":32},{"text":"이름-주소","x":635,"y":877,"width":140,"height":32},{"text":"사이의","x":783,"y":877,"width":86,"height":33},{"text":"변환","x":881,"y":878,"width":58,"height":31},{"text":"프로세스를","x":947,"y":879,"width":144,"height":31},{"text":"구현하는","x":1100,"y":879,"width":116,"height":31},{"text":"DNS는","x":1227,"y":879,"width":99,"height":31},{"text":"그러한","x":1334,"y":880,"width":89,"height":31},{"text":"설계","x":1433,"y":880,"width":55,"height":32},{"text":"철학의","x":1500,"y":880,"width":84,"height":32},{"text":"또","x":1594,"y":883,"width":30,"height":26},{"text":"다른","x":1634,"y":881,"width":56,"height":32},{"text":"예다.","x":1700,"y":880,"width":66,"height":32}]},{"text":"다. 그것은 복잡한 시스템이고, 여기서는 관점에서의 주요 면만 취급하겠다. 관심","words":[{"text":"다.","x":559,"y":1056,"width":42,"height":38},{"text":"그것은","x":616,"y":1058,"width":106,"height":37},{"text":"복잡한","x":734,"y":1058,"width":106,"height":37},{"text":"시스템이고,","x":853,"y":1058,"width":178,"height":38},{"text":"여기서는","x":1048,"y":1057,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"관점에서의","x":1280,"y":1059,"width":171,"height":37},{"text":"주요","x":1468,"y":1062,"width":69,"height":34},{"text":"면만","x":1552,"y":1061,"width":68,"height":35},{"text":"취급하겠다.","x":1634,"y":1060,"width":176,"height":37},{"text":"관심","x":1826,"y":1061,"width":60,"height":40}]},{"text":"있는 독자는 이들 RFC들과 앨비츠(Albitz)와 류(Liu)가 지은 책을 참조하기 바란다","words":[{"text":"있는","x":561,"y":1118,"width":67,"height":36},{"text":"독자는","x":644,"y":1118,"width":106,"height":37},{"text":"이들","x":768,"y":1119,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"RFC들과","x":852,"y":1119,"width":145,"height":36},{"text":"앨비츠(Albitz)와","x":1014,"y":1118,"width":266,"height":39},{"text":"류(Liu)가","x":1295,"y":1119,"width":154,"height":38},{"text":"지은","x":1466,"y":1119,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"책을","x":1552,"y":1120,"width":69,"height":37},{"text":"참조하기","x":1638,"y":1120,"width":132,"height":37},{"text":"바란다","x":1793,"y":1120,"width":96,"height":41}]},{"text":"[Abitz 1993]. 또한 DNS가 무엇이고 왜 존재해야 하는지에 대해 훌륭한 설명을 제공","words":[{"text":"[Abitz","x":558,"y":1183,"width":99,"height":34},{"text":"1993].","x":676,"y":1183,"width":97,"height":35},{"text":"또한","x":789,"y":1179,"width":70,"height":36},{"text":"DNS가","x":872,"y":1178,"width":114,"height":37},{"text":"무엇이고","x":998,"y":1178,"width":139,"height":38},{"text":"왜","x":1152,"y":1178,"width":31,"height":36},{"text":"존재해야","x":1199,"y":1178,"width":142,"height":38},{"text":"하는지에","x":1356,"y":1179,"width":135,"height":37},{"text":"대해","x":1509,"y":1179,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"훌륭한","x":1590,"y":1180,"width":106,"height":37},{"text":"설명을","x":1711,"y":1179,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"제공","x":1827,"y":1181,"width":62,"height":39}]},{"text":"하는 과거를 조명하는 논문 [Mockapetns 1988]과 [Mockapetns 2%5]을 참조하라.","words":[{"text":"하는","x":557,"y":1239,"width":69,"height":36},{"text":"과거를","x":637,"y":1239,"width":105,"height":37},{"text":"조명하는","x":754,"y":1239,"width":138,"height":38},{"text":"논문","x":903,"y":1240,"width":70,"height":35},{"text":"[Mockapetns","x":986,"y":1242,"width":209,"height":37},{"text":"1988]과","x":1213,"y":1239,"width":126,"height":38},{"text":"[Mockapetns","x":1352,"y":1243,"width":208,"height":37},{"text":"2%5]을","x":1575,"y":1240,"width":128,"height":39},{"text":"참조하라.","x":1716,"y":1239,"width":141,"height":37}]},{"text":"24.2 동작원리 개요","words":[{"text":"24.2","x":556,"y":1350,"width":113,"height":41},{"text":"동작원리","x":832,"y":1347,"width":177,"height":46},{"text":"개요","x":1026,"y":1348,"width":85,"height":45}]},{"text":"이제 DNS가 어떻게 동작하는지에 대한 개괄적인 내펑-을 살펴보자. 여기서는 호스트","words":[{"text":"이제","x":556,"y":1449,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"DNS가","x":638,"y":1449,"width":116,"height":38},{"text":"어떻게","x":770,"y":1448,"width":98,"height":39},{"text":"동작하는지에","x":886,"y":1447,"width":205,"height":38},{"text":"대한","x":1110,"y":1447,"width":71,"height":36},{"text":"개괄적인","x":1197,"y":1447,"width":135,"height":37},{"text":"내펑-을","x":1351,"y":1447,"width":104,"height":37},{"text":"살펴보자.","x":1470,"y":1447,"width":147,"height":39},{"text":"여기서는","x":1638,"y":1448,"width":138,"height":38},{"text":"호스트","x":1791,"y":1449,"width":97,"height":33}]},{"text":"네임을 IP 주소로 변환하는 서비스에 초점을 맞춘다.","words":[{"text":"네임을","x":557,"y":1510,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"IP","x":671,"y":1515,"width":34,"height":29},{"text":"주소로","x":717,"y":1512,"width":104,"height":36},{"text":"변환하는","x":835,"y":1509,"width":135,"height":37},{"text":"서비스에","x":983,"y":1508,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"초점을","x":1133,"y":1507,"width":106,"height":37},{"text":"맞춘다.","x":1251,"y":1507,"width":111,"height":38}]},{"text":"사용자의 호스트에서 실행되는 어떤 애플리케이션(웹 브라우저나 메일 리더)이 호","words":[{"text":"사용자의","x":623,"y":1572,"width":134,"height":38},{"text":"호스트에서","x":773,"y":1569,"width":165,"height":39},{"text":"실행되는","x":957,"y":1569,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"어떤","x":1108,"y":1569,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"애플리케이션(웹","x":1190,"y":1568,"width":253,"height":39},{"text":"브라우저나","x":1459,"y":1568,"width":176,"height":39},{"text":"메일","x":1649,"y":1570,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"리더)이","x":1733,"y":1568,"width":108,"height":39},{"text":"호","x":1857,"y":1572,"width":31,"height":31}]},{"text":"스트 네임을 IP 주소로 변환시기려 한다고 가정하자. 그 애플리케이션은 변환될 흐八","words":[{"text":"스트","x":559,"y":1638,"width":68,"height":29},{"text":"네임을","x":642,"y":1634,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"IP","x":757,"y":1639,"width":35,"height":28},{"text":"주소로","x":806,"y":1634,"width":103,"height":36},{"text":"변환시기려","x":926,"y":1630,"width":166,"height":39},{"text":"한다고","x":1111,"y":1630,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"가정하자.","x":1231,"y":1629,"width":146,"height":39},{"text":"그","x":1394,"y":1634,"width":36,"height":26},{"text":"애플리케이션은","x":1446,"y":1629,"width":245,"height":39},{"text":"변환될","x":1708,"y":1629,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"흐八","x":1828,"y":1631,"width":58,"height":30}]},{"text":"트 네임을 명시하여 DNS 측의 클라이언트를 호출할 것이다(많은 유닉스 기반의 컴퓨","words":[{"text":"트","x":558,"y":1700,"width":34,"height":28},{"text":"네임을","x":608,"y":1695,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"명시하여","x":723,"y":1693,"width":130,"height":39},{"text":"DNS","x":870,"y":1697,"width":75,"height":29},{"text":"측의","x":961,"y":1692,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"클라이언트를","x":1044,"y":1691,"width":209,"height":38},{"text":"호출할","x":1266,"y":1690,"width":106,"height":37},{"text":"것이다(많은","x":1386,"y":1690,"width":188,"height":39},{"text":"유닉스","x":1587,"y":1691,"width":105,"height":37},{"text":"기반의","x":1708,"y":1689,"width":98,"height":39},{"text":"컴퓨","x":1826,"y":1689,"width":62,"height":39}]},{"text":"터가 그러하듯 gethostbyname () 은 변환을 실행하기 위한 애플리게이션을 호출","words":[{"text":"터가","x":559,"y":1756,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"그러하듯","x":642,"y":1755,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"gethostbyname","x":794,"y":1760,"width":303,"height":35},{"text":"()","x":1110,"y":1759,"width":27,"height":31},{"text":"은","x":1148,"y":1755,"width":35,"height":35},{"text":"변환을","x":1200,"y":1752,"width":103,"height":36},{"text":"실행하기","x":1320,"y":1751,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"위한","x":1478,"y":1751,"width":70,"height":38},{"text":"애플리게이션을","x":1564,"y":1750,"width":244,"height":38},{"text":"호출","x":1824,"y":1751,"width":64,"height":36}]},{"text":"하는 함수이다.) 그리고 사용자 호스트의 DNS는 네트워크에 질의 메시지를 보낸다.","words":[{"text":"하는","x":557,"y":1817,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"함수이다.)","x":641,"y":1816,"width":159,"height":39},{"text":"그리고","x":818,"y":1815,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"사용자","x":936,"y":1814,"width":104,"height":40},{"text":"호스트의","x":1056,"y":1815,"width":135,"height":37},{"text":"DNS는","x":1211,"y":1814,"width":115,"height":34},{"text":"네트워크에","x":1344,"y":1812,"width":171,"height":38},{"text":"질의","x":1537,"y":1812,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"메시지를","x":1623,"y":1811,"width":140,"height":38},{"text":"보낸다.","x":1779,"y":1809,"width":107,"height":38}]},{"text":"모든 DNS 질의와 응답 메시지는 포트 53의 UDP 데이터그램으로 보내진다. 수 msec","words":[{"text":"모든","x":556,"y":1879,"width":68,"height":35},{"text":"DNS","x":637,"y":1881,"width":75,"height":29},{"text":"질의와","x":731,"y":1876,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"응답","x":844,"y":1876,"width":70,"height":38},{"text":"메시지는","x":927,"y":1876,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"포트","x":1077,"y":1879,"width":69,"height":27},{"text":"53의","x":1159,"y":1873,"width":70,"height":39},{"text":"UDP","x":1246,"y":1878,"width":79,"height":29},{"text":"데이터그램으로","x":1341,"y":1872,"width":245,"height":38},{"text":"보내진다.","x":1600,"y":1872,"width":147,"height":37},{"text":"수","x":1763,"y":1871,"width":36,"height":37},{"text":"msec","x":1811,"y":1883,"width":76,"height":21}]},{"text":"에서 수 sec의 지연 후에 사용자 호스트의 DNS는 요청한 매핑(mapping)에 해당하는","words":[{"text":"에서","x":557,"y":1938,"width":62,"height":38},{"text":"수","x":637,"y":1937,"width":34,"height":38},{"text":"sec의","x":685,"y":1937,"width":81,"height":38},{"text":"지연","x":785,"y":1937,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"후에","x":866,"y":1938,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"사용자","x":948,"y":1937,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"호스트의","x":1065,"y":1935,"width":135,"height":37},{"text":"DNS는","x":1217,"y":1935,"width":114,"height":35},{"text":"요청한","x":1344,"y":1933,"width":1